#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Values greater than one indicate that Orbit reduces the energy error relative to execution without dynamical decoupling.\n"
msgstr "Nilai yang lebih besar dari satu menunjukkan bahwa Orbit mengurangi error energi relatif terhadap eksekusi tanpa dynamical decoupling.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**QAOA success probability:** Probability of measuring a bitstring corresponding to an optimal solution of the optimization problem defined on the butterfly graph. The reported improvement compares the success probability obtained with Orbit against that obtained from the raw circuits.\n"
msgstr "**Probabilitas keberhasilan QAOA:** Probabilitas mengukur bitstring yang sesuai dengan solusi optimal dari masalah optimasi yang didefinisikan pada graf butterfly. Peningkatan yang dilaporkan membandingkan probabilitas keberhasilan yang diperoleh dengan Orbit terhadap yang diperoleh dari circuit mentah.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Logical fidelity:** In the [[4,2,2]] logical dynamical-decoupling experiment [1], two logical qubits were encoded into four physical qubits and prepared as an entangled logical Bell state. Logical fidelity measures the agreement between the recovered encoded state and the target logical Bell state. The reported improvement compares the average logical fidelity obtained with Orbit and error detection (code's capability) to that obtained when only using the code alone.\n"
msgstr "**Fidelitas logis:** Dalam eksperimen dynamical decoupling logis [[4,2,2]] [1], dua qubit logis dikodekan ke dalam empat qubit fisik dan disiapkan sebagai keadaan Bell logis yang di-entangle. Fidelitas logis mengukur kesesuaian antara keadaan yang dikodekan yang dipulihkan dan keadaan Bell logis target. Peningkatan yang dilaporkan membandingkan fidelitas logis rata-rata yang diperoleh dengan Orbit dan deteksi error (kapabilitas kode) terhadap yang diperoleh saat hanya menggunakan kode saja.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Mulai {#get-started}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate using your [IBM Quantum Platform API key](http://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), and select the Orbit function as follows. This snippet assumes you've already [saved your account](/guides/functions-get-started#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client) to your local environment.\n"
msgstr "Autentikasi menggunakan [IBM Quantum Platform API key](http://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) kamu, dan pilih fungsi Orbit sebagai berikut. Snippet ini mengasumsikan kamu sudah [menyimpan akunmu](/guides/functions-get-started#install-qiskit-functions-catalog-client) ke environment lokalmu.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example {#example}"
msgstr "Contoh {#example}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following example builds a Bernstein-Vazirani circuit and submits it to Orbit two ways in one job: raw execution and Orbit defaults.\n"
msgstr "Contoh berikut membangun circuit Bernstein-Vazirani dan mengirimkannya ke Orbit dengan dua cara dalam satu job: eksekusi mentah dan default Orbit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use this pattern when you want a direct raw-versus-Orbit comparison.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan pola ini ketika kamu ingin perbandingan langsung antara mentah dan Orbit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a Bernstein-Vazirani circuit {#build-a-bernstein-vazirani-circuit}"
msgstr "Bangun circuit Bernstein-Vazirani {#build-a-bernstein-vazirani-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the hidden bitstring and construct the logical circuit. The extra qubit is the oracle target, while the input qubits are measured.\n"
msgstr "Pilih bitstring tersembunyi dan bangun circuit logis. Qubit tambahan adalah target oracle, sedangkan qubit input diukur.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the Orbit workload {#prepare-the-orbit-workload}"
msgstr "Siapkan workload Orbit {#prepare-the-orbit-workload}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create one Sampler PUB, then duplicate it for the two comparison modes. Orbit receives the logical circuit and maps it to the selected backend during execution.\n"
msgstr "Buat satu Sampler PUB, lalu duplikasi untuk dua mode perbandingan. Orbit menerima circuit logis dan memetakannya ke backend yang dipilih selama eksekusi.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run raw and Orbit defaults {#run-raw-and-orbit-defaults}"
msgstr "Jalankan mentah dan default Orbit {#run-raw-and-orbit-defaults}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`pub_options` assigns the first PUB to raw mode, which skips Orbit optimization, DD, and MEM, and assigns the second PUB to Orbit defaults, which include optimized transpilation, automated dynamical decoupling (DD) insertion, and measurement error mitigation (MEM).\n"
msgstr "`pub_options` menetapkan PUB pertama ke mode mentah, yang melewati optimasi Orbit, DD, dan MEM, dan menetapkan PUB kedua ke default Orbit, yang mencakup transpilasi yang dioptimalkan, penyisipan dynamical decoupling (DD) otomatis, dan mitigasi error pengukuran (MEM).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve the result and compare the raw and Orbit-enhanced circuits using counts. For Sampler results, `get_counts()` on the returned classical register provides the output histogram. When MEM succeeds for the Orbit PUB, this histogram is already MEM-corrected; the unmitigated counts remain available in the Orbit metadata under `measurementErrorMitigation[\"rawCounts\"]`.\n"
msgstr "Ambil hasil dan bandingkan circuit mentah dan circuit yang ditingkatkan Orbit menggunakan counts. Untuk hasil Sampler, `get_counts()` pada classical register yang dikembalikan memberikan histogram output. Ketika MEM berhasil untuk PUB Orbit, histogram ini sudah dikoreksi MEM; counts yang belum dimitigasi tetap tersedia dalam metadata Orbit di bawah `measurementErrorMitigation[\"rawCounts\"]`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make a visual comparison of the raw and Orbit-enhanced circuits.\n"
msgstr "Buat perbandingan visual antara circuit mentah dan circuit yang ditingkatkan Orbit.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/quantum-elements-orbit/extracted-outputs/7656f768-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/quantum-elements-orbit/extracted-outputs/7656f768-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get support {#get-support}"
msgstr "Dapatkan dukungan {#get-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reach out to Quantum Elements support: [info@quantumelements.ai](mailto:info@quantumelements.ai)\n"
msgstr "Hubungi dukungan Quantum Elements: [info@quantumelements.ai](mailto:info@quantumelements.ai)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Be sure to include the following information:\n"
msgstr "Pastikan untuk menyertakan informasi berikut:\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Function Job ID (`qiskit-ibm-catalog`), `job.job_id`\n"
msgstr "Qiskit Function Job ID (`qiskit-ibm-catalog`), `job.job_id`\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backend name\n"
msgstr "Nama backend\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orbit `pub_options` used for the raw and Orbit modes\n"
msgstr "`pub_options` Orbit yang digunakan untuk mode mentah dan Orbit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A detailed description of the issue\n"
msgstr "Deskripsi terperinci tentang masalah\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Any relevant error messages or codes\n"
msgstr "Pesan atau kode error yang relevan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps to reproduce the issue\n"
msgstr "Langkah-langkah untuk mereproduksi masalah\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Try a different backend, qubit number, or another hidden bitstring.\n"
msgstr "Coba backend, jumlah qubit, atau bitstring tersembunyi lain yang berbeda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Read [our tutorial](/tutorials/quantum-elements-orbit-qft-with-dynamic-circuits) on the quantum Fourier transform to learn how to define orbit-enabled custom DD strategies, as well as to apply DD to dynamic circuits with mid-circuit measurements and feedforward operations.\n"
msgstr "Baca [tutorial kami](/tutorials/quantum-elements-orbit-qft-with-dynamic-circuits) tentang transformasi Fourier kuantum untuk mempelajari cara mendefinisikan strategi DD kustom yang mendukung Orbit, serta menerapkan DD pada dynamic circuit dengan pengukuran mid-circuit dan operasi feedforward.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/quantum-elements-orbit) for a detailed description of all Orbit options.\n"
msgstr "Kunjungi [referensi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/quantum-elements-orbit) untuk deskripsi terperinci semua opsi Orbit.\n"

